  ('mathematics/de1-laplace-trig-formula', 'mathematics', 'mathematics/differential-equations-1', 2000548, 'formula', 4, false, 'What are $\mathcal{L}\{\sin bt\}$ and $\mathcal{L}\{\cos bt\}$ for a real constant $b$?', '$\mathcal{L}\{\sin bt\} = \dfrac{b}{s^2 + b^2}$ and $\mathcal{L}\{\cos bt\} = \dfrac{s}{s^2 + b^2}$, for $s > 0$.

